name: "mshaders"
displayName: "Mindustry Shaders"
author: "REDEagle0705, Claude"
description: "Visual effects only: water with reflections, ice and ground effects, directional block shadows, lights that blocks and units stop, metal glint, hand-drawn normal maps that light blocks and units by calculation, engines of units as streaks of light, shields like glass bubbles, explosions with shock waves and scorch marks, waves from menders, status effects shown on units, weather on the ground (rain, snow, sandstorms), heat haze, smoke shadows, slag, tar and cryofluid, day and night, lasers that burn what they hit, and a colour pass. Every effect can be switched off in Settings > Shaders. Client-side, adds no content. Desktop and Android. Tested on v160.7."
version: "0.2.2"
main: "mshaders.ShaderMod"
minGameVersion: "160"
java: true
hidden: true
